{"3694100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unshine Arcade", "steam_appid": 3694100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/e01a237792d7458f256f7336eb83f6b8.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/e01a237792d7458f256f7336eb83f6b8.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/e01a237792d7458f256f7336eb83f6b8.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the (S)Unshine Arcade!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... is what the mysterious virtual pet says, stuck in the 'Grand Prize' cabinet that really wants you to free it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several arcade cabinets are scattered throughout the arcade, but someone really wants you to play this one game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they make it? What's going on with this arcade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... Why is there blood?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/75bd5ec77ae0b67dd1977224c5410343.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/75bd5ec77ae0b67dd1977224c5410343.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/75bd5ec77ae0b67dd1977224c5410343.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unshine Arcade combines fast-paced action roguelite stealth-shooter arcade madness with psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tickets, find gacha balls, and discover meta-progression secrets that make each run deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=764 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out of the (S)Unshine Arcade as you discover the truth about its horrifying past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get betrayed along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\