e each run deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=764 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/01f7b2972fc3bf9c422e780db54fd468.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out of the (S)Unshine Arcade as you discover the truth about its horrifying past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get betrayed along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.poster.avif?t=1788289996\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.webm?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694100/extras/4cb53dd5d9bc06a575c017fc9c3ea8e7.mp4?t=1788289996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "An arcade full of secrets, a sentient virtual pet in the prize cabinet, a stealth shooter roguelite arcade machine and one way to escape: win tickets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Simpl